  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "ABI minimalist marketplace",
    "overview": "The approved o11-inspired direction uses a near-white field, quiet neutral rows, readable dark text and restrained blue actions. ABI keeps its wordmark and self-hosted IBM Plex family. The approved minimal-reference overview, catalog and billing studies plus .impeccable/briefs/minimal-marketplace.md define the chosen world; current source defines actual controls and values. Earlier navy-rail Assisted Shopping Studio and beige/green directions are superseded.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
